# A delta on es.po, not a translation in its own right: it names only what
# differs regionally, and everything else falls through to es.po and then
# to the compiled-in English, one message at a time.
#
# DRAFTED, NOT REVIEWED -- see es.po.
#
# Latin American usage writes "archivo" for a file where Spain writes
# "fichero", and "arreglo" for an array where Spain writes "matriz".
#
